{"slug":"veliaht-2025-1it35y","title":"ترکی ولیعهد","titleEn":"Crown Prince","type":"series","year":2025,"rating":6.9,"duration":45,"description":"Zülfükar Karslı, who is beginning to lose his former power at the bus station and is searching for an heir to succeed him instead of his son, crosses paths with Timur, a travelling repairman struggling with debts left by his father. This encounter will fundamentally change everyone's lives, especially Zülfükar Karslı's son Zafer, and his daughters Kudret, Derya, and Cennet. Timur, who steps into the bus station as Zafer Karslı, must also play the role of husband and wife with Zafer's wife Reyhan. However, the act will gradually turn into reality, and the two captives in the Karslı Mansion, Timur and Reyhan, will have to fight for their love in this world woven with lies.","genres":["اکشن","درام","عاشقانه"],"poster":"/covers/tt37137373/poster.jpg","backdrop":"https://images.metahub.space/background/large/tt37137373/img","posterUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/small/tt37137373/img","backdropUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt37137373/img","videoUrl":"","trailerUrl":null,"director":"Sinan Öztürk","cast":["Akin Akinözü","Serra Arıtürk","Ercan Kesal"],"country":"ترکیه","ageRating":"+13","quality":"720p","sources":[],"featured":false,"trendingScore":69,"views":83100,"source":"od","addedAt":"2026-09-05T23:47:50.802Z","episodes":[{"season":1,"number":1,"name":"قسمت 1","synopsis":"","duration":45,"videoUrl":"https://dls3.varzeshha3-uploader.top/DonyayeSerial/series4/tt37137373/Dubbed/S01/720p.Web-DL/Veliaht.S01E01.720p.Web-DL.DUAL.AUDIO.PER.TUR.Dubbed.DonyayeSerial.mkv","sources":[{"q":"720p","v":"دوبله فارسی","url":"https://dls3.varzeshha3-uploader.top/DonyayeSerial/series4/tt37137373/Dubbed/S01/720p.Web-DL/Veliaht.S01E01.720p.Web-DL.DUAL.AUDIO.PER.TUR.Dubbed.DonyayeSerial.mkv","mb":1299}],"thumbnail":"/covers/tt37137373/poster.jpg"},{"season":1,"number":2,"name":"قسمت 2","synopsis":"","duration":45,"